# PRACTICULARIUM Platform 2.0

# Fiscal Request Specification v1.0

---

## Document Information

Document: Fiscal Request Specification

Version: 1.0

Status: Approved

Module: Fiscal Engine

Applies to: PRACTICULARIUM Platform 2.0

---

# 1. Purpose

This document defines the Internal Fiscal Request model used inside PRACTICULARIUM Platform 2.0.

The Internal Fiscal Request represents the contract between OMS and Fiscal Providers.

It is independent from any external API implementation.

---

# 2. Objectives

The Internal Fiscal Request shall:

- isolate OMS from external Fiscal Providers;
- provide a unified request model;
- simplify Provider implementation;
- support multiple Fiscal Providers;
- remain stable even if external APIs change.

---

# 3. Design Principles

The Internal Fiscal Request follows these principles:

- Provider Independence
- Internal Data Ownership
- No Business Logic
- No Calculations
- Immutable After Build

---

# 4. General Structure

```javascript
FiscalRequest {

    seller,

    customer,

    items,

    payment,

    totals,

    metadata

}
```

---

# 5. Seller

Contains seller information.

Typical fields:

- Seller Name
- Tax Number
- Business Unit
- Business Address

Source:

Fiscal Configuration

---

# 6. Customer

Contains customer information.

Source:

data.customer

Typical fields:

- First Name
- Last Name
- Email
- Phone

---

# 7. Items

Represents products included in the fiscal receipt.

Each item contains:

- Product Name
- Quantity
- Unit Price
- Total Price

Source:

data.product

---

# 8. Payment

Contains payment information.

Source:

data.payment

Typical fields:

- Payment Method
- Payment Type
- Paid Amount

---

# 9. Totals

Contains financial totals.

Source:

data.pricing

Typical fields:

- Products Total
- Delivery Total
- Grand Total
- Currency

---

# 10. Metadata

Contains internal OMS information.

Typical fields:

- Order Number
- Order Date
- Internal Reference
- Platform Version

Metadata is never displayed on the fiscal receipt.

---

# 11. Provider Mapping

Internal Fiscal Request is transformed by the selected Fiscal Provider into the external API format.

OMS never communicates directly using Provider-specific structures.

---

# 12. Version History

| Version | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| 1.0 | Initial Internal Fiscal Request Specification |

---

